"""
Tableau Prep Script: JEWOSC EW fusion enrichment.

Generated by tableau-prep-etl skill from templates/ew_fusion.py.j2.

Consumes one dataframe of live ADS-B state vectors (one row per aircraft
snapshot) and fuses each track with a synthetic Electronic Order of
Battle (EOB) library keyed on airframe class. Outputs per-row:

  emitter_class       - fused platform class (fighter, isr, transport, rotary, awacs, drone, unknown)
  primary_emitter     - representative radar/EW payload for that class (synthetic reference names)
  rf_band             - notional band (L / S / C / X / Ku / EHF / VHF-UHF)
  centre_freq_ghz     - representative centre frequency (decimal, GHz)
  pri_us              - representative pulse repetition interval, microseconds
  pw_us               - representative pulse width, microseconds
  erp_dbw             - effective radiated power in dBW
  mode                - notional EW mode (search / track / target / jam / passive / silent)
  range_nm            - great-circle range from own-ship reference to aircraft (nm)
  bearing_deg         - initial bearing from own-ship reference to aircraft (0-360 deg)
  aspect_deg          - track aspect relative to own-ship (0 = nose, 180 = tail)
  rx_dbm              - notional received power at own-ship (dBm; free-space Friis)
  threat_band         - Non-hostile / Search / Track / Engage / Critical
  fusion_confidence   - 0..1 (falls off when class inference is weak or geometry missing)

Pure single-row derivations — no cross-row aggregation. Uses a small,
deterministic synthetic EOB library baked into the script; the numbers
are notional and illustrative, NOT drawn from any classified source.

Configured by spec:
  lat_col             = "{{ lat_col }}"
  lon_col             = "{{ lon_col }}"
  alt_col             = "{{ alt_col }}"      (metres)
  velocity_col        = "{{ velocity_col }}" (m/s)
  heading_col         = "{{ heading_col }}"  (degrees true)
  callsign_col        = "{{ callsign_col }}"
  category_col        = "{{ category_col }}"  (ADS-B category if present, else "")
  icao_col            = "{{ icao_col }}"
  own_ship_lat        = {{ own_ship_lat }}   (decimal degrees)
  own_ship_lon        = {{ own_ship_lon }}   (decimal degrees)
  own_ship_label      = "{{ own_ship_label }}"
"""
import math
import random

